<title>USA: Atchison Casting buys Pennsylvania foundry.</title>
<headline>Atchison Casting buys Pennsylvania foundry.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atchison Casting Corp said Friday it acquired Pennsylvania Steel Foundry &amp; Machine Co from Citation Corp for about $9 million, including assumption of debt.</p>
<p>The Hamburg, Pa.-based foundry, which has 330 employees, had sales for the past 12 months of about $19 million.</p>
<p>Atchison Casting produces iron, steel and nonferrous castings for a wide variety of equipment.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
